<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px">Delete your account</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Hi <%= firstName %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Enter this code in <%= app.name %> to permanently delete your account, your chats and your files. It expires in <%= minutes %> minutes.</p>
<p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;margin:24px 0;color:#d32f2f"><%= code %></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#666;font-size:13px">If you didn't ask to delete your account, ignore this email and change your password: someone may be logged in as you.</p>
